<title>USA: Orangeburg SD #2, S.C., $10 mln sale postponed.</title>
<headline>Orangeburg SD #2, S.C., $10 mln sale postponed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A $10 million Orangeburg School District #2, S.C, general obligation bond sale slated for competitive sale at 1200 EDT on Wednesday, has been postponed, according to the issuer's bond counsel.</p>
<p>No new date has been selected, although the issue is expected to sell competitively before the end of the month, said Sinkler &amp; Boyd. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
